ज्ञानाग्निदग्धकर्माणं तमाहुः पण्डितं बुधाः ॥ १९ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1407,\"bb\":1251,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/19/b1251/\",\"body_value\":\"yasya sarve samārambhāḥ
